{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/09e7f39575b47d1afcca7cf952753453.avif?t=1773302402\" width=1232 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/1dbaba61c7ee008ccb14488a6663bd25.avif?t=1773302402\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Award-Winning Gameplay:</strong>\u00a0Winner of Dice Con's Best Chinese Indie Board Game of the Year, with tried-and-true gameplay that promises endless fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Depth:</strong>\u00a0Easy to pick up, hard to master\u2014familiar card and board-game mechanics with endless tactical possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Modes:</strong>\u00a0Face off in tense one-on-one duels, compete online, or challenge yourself in Roguelike arena runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oriental Aesthetics:</strong>\u00a0Immerse yourself in the artistry of traditional martial arts fused with modern visuals.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/aba8be4bd8acb31e366927c0fe8d4887.avif?t=1773302402\" width=660 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core rules of <i>Kungfu Card</i> blend the principles of Poker and Mahjong, making it incredibly easy to pick up. The game uses numbered cards from 1 to 9, divided into four suits\u2014Fist, Palm, Kick, and Elbow\u2014for offense and defense. You can probe your opponent with low-value cards to bait out their defense, or build up high-value moves for a relentless assault. While it might seem like a simple game of high and low numbers, it's actually a pure psychological mind game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/5341c7332274e3425be44d7f098f7de4.poster.avif?t=1773302402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/5341c7332274e3425be44d7f098f7de4.webm?t=1773302402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/5341c7332274e3425be44d7f098f7de4.mp4?t=1773302402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/c7f012696e2f5a9a1c7185baec4b9e52.avif?t=1773302402\" width=660 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think like a true martial arts master and switch fluidly between three stances:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offensive Stance:</strong> If your card values are too low, combine two cards into one devastating strike that is hard to block.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defensive Stance:</strong> When facing an overwhelming assault, turn offense into defense by playing two attack cards as a single defense card to adapt to the threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feint Stance:</strong> If you're stuck with a bad hand, discard any two cards and redraw to search for the perfect opening.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/fbe82e857ed6e36882d9baff672808a7.poster.avif?t=1773302402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/fbe82e857ed6e36882d9baff672808a7.webm?t=1773302402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/fbe82e857ed6e36882d9baff672808a7.mp4?t=1773302402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The highest realm of martial arts is using your opponent's strength against them, and <i>Kungfu Card</i> is no different. Always read your opponent's plays. The moment your played card forms a straight (consecutive numbers, like 1-2-3) or a triplet (three of the same number) with the cards on the field, you trigger a <strong>&quot;Disrupt&quot;</strong>. A Disrupt completely negates all damage for the current round and grants you a moment of enlightenment, allowing you to draw a powerful <strong>&quot;Technique&quot;</strong> card from your deck for a game-changing victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/921b75ef7192a16249d1ca29d9b96264.poster.avif?t=1773302402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/921b75ef7192a16249d1ca29d9b96264.webm?t=1773302402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/921b75ef7192a16249d1ca29d9b96264.mp4?t=1773302402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/6998cc7f346f0c8989e33f4937e3b4e7.avif?t=1773302402\" width=660 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Martial Arts: From Emei with its many forms to the unpredictable Drunken Fist, each style has its own philosophy and playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define Your Style: Victory begins in preparation. Choose Principles and Techniques that synergize to create a strategy uniquely yours\u2014for you are the grandmaster of your style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/6cd24488cb794601066ade75a5c4b118.avif?t=1773302402\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/0aeb5bb66c363fb75906188f49093045.avif?t=1773302402\" width=660 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge others in Kung Fu Cards, online or locally.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 Ranked Matches: Hone your skills on the ladder and fight your way to the top in intense duels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skirmish Zone \u2013 Multiplayer Free-for-All (coming soon): Battle 4\u20138 players in chaotic, last-one-standing matches.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether climbing the ranks or dueling friends, every fight tests your martial prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/1b32d94d041d9576ac79128940c36291.poster.avif?t=1773302402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/1b32d94d041d9576ac79128940c36291.webm?t=1773302402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/1b32d94d041d9576ac79128940c36291.mp4?t=1773302402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/1c78be5e9343c9047d8cf442349a4f56.avif?t=1773302402\" width=660 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Martial Tournament mode (coming soon) and grow stronger through a roguelike adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware! Your opponents are more than mere fighters. They're Mirror Phantoms, echoes of players who have walked this path before and prevailed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succeed, and your deck becomes a Guardian, leaving a Mirror Phantom behind for future challengers.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3340780?t=1773302402","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3340780?t=1773302402","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/5ef7ed1b0d96a8c151f7e4bd267bb335d91d1e98/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1773302402","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/5ef7ed1b0d96a8c151f7e4bd267bb335d91d1e98/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1773302402","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/09e7f39575b47d1afcca7cf952753453.avif?t=1773302402\" width=1232 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com