 highest realm of martial arts is using your opponent's strength against them, and <i>Kungfu Card</i> is no different. Always read your opponent's plays. The moment your played card forms a straight (consecutive numbers, like 1-2-3) or a triplet (three of the same number) with the cards on the field, you trigger a <strong>&quot;Disrupt&quot;</strong>. A Disrupt completely negates all damage for the current round and grants you a moment of enlightenment, allowing you to draw a powerful <strong>&quot;Technique&quot;</strong> card from your deck for a game-changing victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/921b75ef7192a16249d1ca29d9b96264.poster.avif?t=1773302402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/921b75ef7192a16249d1ca29d9b96264.webm?t=1773302402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/921b75ef7192a16249d1ca29d9b96264.mp4?t=1773302402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/6998cc7f346f0c8989e33f4937e3b4e7.avif?t=1773302402\" width=660 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Martial Arts: From Emei with its many forms to the unpredictable Drunken Fist, each style has its own philosophy and playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define Your Style: Victory begins in preparation. Choose Principles and Techniques that synergize to create a strategy uniquely yours\u2014for you are the grandmaster of your style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/6cd24488cb794601066ade75a5c4b118.avif?t=1773302402\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/0aeb5bb66c363fb75906188f49093045.avif?t=1773302402\" width=660 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge others in Kung Fu Cards, online or locally.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 Ranked Matches: Hone your skills on the ladder and fight your way to the top in intense duels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skirmish Zone \u2013 Multiplayer Free-for-All (coming soon): Battle 4\u20138 players in chaotic, last-one-standing matches.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether climbing the ranks or dueling friends, every fight tests your martial prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/1b32d94d041d9576ac79128940c36291.poster.avif?t=1773302402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/1b32d94d041d9576ac79128940c36291.webm?t=1773302402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/1b32d94d041d9576ac79128940c36291.mp4?t=1773302402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340780/extras/1c78be5e9343c9047d8cf442349a4f56.avif?t=1773302402\" width=660 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Martial Tournament mode (coming soon) and grow stronger